  - protocol
abstract: >-
  GeoSpark is an open-source Geospatial Intelligence Protocol and Engine
  that gives AI models genuine spatial reasoning capabilities. Current LLMs
  fail 42-80% on spatial tasks; GeoSpark provides ground-truth spatial
  computation via a standardized protocol, pluggable tool system, and
  MCP server integration.
